#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the left axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Nígbà tí o bá ṣètò àmì ákísì òsì, fi òfin kan sí ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ dátà. Àwọn ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ tí a ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn fún ní \"numeric\" níbi tí a ti ń ṣe dátà gẹ́gẹ́ bí nọ́ńbà, \"timestamp\" níbi tí a ti ń túmọ̀ àwọn iye gẹ́gẹ́ bí àmì àkókò UNIX (nọ́ńbà àwọn ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá láti Oṣù Ṣẹẹrẹ 1970) tí a sì fi hàn ní lílo ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ strftime (àìyípadà jẹ́ \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\"). Wo --units-length pẹ̀lú. Ní ìparí \"duration\" níbi tí a ti ń túmọ̀ àwọn iye gẹ́gẹ́ bí ìwọ̀n àkókò ní ìdá-ẹgbẹ̀rún ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá. Ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ tẹ̀lé àwọn òfin PRINT/GPRINT tí ó péye pẹ̀lú valstrfduration."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the right axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length and --right-axis-format.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Nígbà tí o bá ṣètò àmì ákísì ọ̀tún, fi òfin kan sí ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ dátà. Àwọn ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ tí a ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn fún ní \"numeric\" níbi tí a ti ń ṣe dátà gẹ́gẹ́ bí nọ́ńbà, \"timestamp\" níbi tí a ti ń túmọ̀ àwọn iye gẹ́gẹ́ bí àmì àkókò UNIX (nọ́ńbà àwọn ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá láti Oṣù Ṣẹẹrẹ 1970) tí a sì fi hàn ní lílo ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ strftime (àìyípadà jẹ́ \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\"). Wo --units-length àti --right-axis-format pẹ̀lú. Ní ìparí \"duration\" níbi tí a ti ń túmọ̀ àwọn iye gẹ́gẹ́ bí ìwọ̀n àkókò ní ìdá-ẹgbẹ̀rún ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá. Ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ tẹ̀lé àwọn òfin PRINT/GPRINT tí ó péye pẹ̀lú valstrfduration."

