#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hours that samples refused by RRDtool, for example after a data source schema change, stay queued for retry before they are moved to the poller_output_rejected table.  Repair the RRDfile, then run cli/replay_rejected_samples.php to process them."
msgstr "Àwọn wákàtí tí àwọn àpẹẹrẹ tí RRDtool kọ̀, fún àpẹẹrẹ lẹ́yìn àyípadà síkímà orísun dátà, yóò wà ní ìlà fún ìtúngbìyànjú kí a tó gbé wọn lọ sí tábìlì poller_output_rejected. Tún RRDfile ṣe, lẹ́yìn náà ṣiṣẹ́ cli/replay_rejected_samples.php láti ṣe àtúnṣe wọn."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Boost distributes RRD updates. Forked processes start the number of Boost processes above on every run. Message queue workers hand each partition to Messenger workers instead."
msgstr "Bí Boost ṣe ń pín àwọn àtúnṣe RRD. Àwọn ìṣiṣẹ́ tí a pín máa ń bẹ̀rẹ̀ iye àwọn ìṣiṣẹ́ Boost lókè ní gbogbo ìṣiṣẹ́. Àwọn òṣìṣẹ́ ìlà ìránṣẹ́ máa ń fi apá kọ̀ọ̀kan lé àwọn òṣìṣẹ́ Messenger lọ́wọ́ dípò."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Often Should Boost Update All RRDs"
msgstr "Báwo ni Boost ṣe yẹ kí ó máa ṣe àtúnṣe Gbogbo Àwọn RRD Lóòrèkóòrè Tó"

