#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Timespan displayed when viewing Graphs and other time specific data."
msgstr "Àkókò Ìgbà àìyípadà tí a fi hàn nígbà tí a bá ń wo Àwọn Gíráfù àti dátà pàtó àkókò mìíràn."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default graph tree to use when displaying graphs in tree mode."
msgstr "Igi gíráfù àìyípadà láti lò nígbà tí a bá ń fi gíráfù hàn ní ipò igi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Kadupul's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Nọ́ńbà pípọ̀jù àìyípadà ti Àwọn OID SNMP Get láti béèrè fún ìbéèrè snmpget kọ̀ọ̀kan. Fún Àwọn Ẹ̀rọ, a ń darí ètò yìí ní ìpele Ẹ̀rọ. O gbọ́dọ̀ lo ètò yìí nìkan nígbà tí o bá ń lo API SNMP ti Kadupul ní ìpilẹ̀ nínú àwọn síkíríìtì tàbí àfikún rẹ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of Device Threads.  This is only applicable when using the Spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Nọ́ńbà àìyípadà ti Àwọn Okùn Ẹ̀rọ. Èyí wúlò kìkì nígbà tí a bá ń lo Olùkójọ Dátà Spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of concurrent processes to execute per Data Collector.  NOTE: Starting from Kadupul 1.2, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector.  Moving forward, this value is only a preset for the Data Collector.  Using a higher number when using cmd.php will improve performance.  Performance improvements in Spine are best resolved with the threads parameter.  When using Spine, we recommend a lower number and leveraging threads instead.  When using cmd.php, use no more than 2x the number of CPU cores."
msgstr "Nọ́ńbà àìyípadà ti àwọn ìlànà tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ lẹ́ẹ̀kan náà fún Olùkójọ Dátà kọ̀ọ̀kan. ÀKÍYÈSÍ: Bẹ̀rẹ̀ láti Kadupul 1.2, a ń ṣàkóso ètò yìí nínú Olùkójọ Dátà. Lọ síwájú, iye yìí jẹ́ àtòtẹ́lẹ̀ lásán fún Olùkójọ Dátà. Lílo nọ́ńbà tó ga jù nígbà tí a bá ń lo cmd.php yóò mú iṣẹ́ dára sí i. Ìdàgbàsókè iṣẹ́ nínú Spine dára jù láti yanjú pẹ̀lú àṣàyàn okùn. Nígbà tí a bá ń lo Spine, a dámọ̀ràn nọ́ńbà tó kéré àti lílo àwọn okùn dípò. Nígbà tí a bá ń lo cmd.php, má ṣe lo ju 2x nọ́ńbà àwọn ohun èlò CPU lọ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of rows to display on for a table."
msgstr "Nọ́ńbà àìyípadà ti àwọn ìlà láti fi hàn fún tábìlì kan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of rows to return from an autocomplete based select pattern match."
msgstr "Nọ́ńbà àìyípadà ti àwọn ìlà láti dá padà láti inú ìbámu àpẹẹrẹ yíyàn tó dá lórí ìparí fúnra rẹ̀."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default polling sync interval to use when creating a poller.  This setting will affect how often remote pollers are checked and updated."
msgstr "Àkókò ìbáramu ìṣàkójọ àìyípadà láti lò nígbà tí a bá ń ṣẹ̀dá olùṣàkójọ. Ètò yìí yóò nípa lórí bí a ṣe ń ṣàyẹ̀wò àti ṣàtúnṣe àwọn olùṣàkójọ jíjìn."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The encryption method to use for the Email."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà ìfipamọ́-àṣírí láti lò fún Ímeèlì."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the backup proxy is using. This required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Ìtẹ̀ka kọ́kọ́rọ́ RSA gbogbogbòò lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ tí aṣojú àfikún ń lò. Èyí pọndandan láti ṣètò ìsopọ̀ tí a gbẹ́kẹ̀lé."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the proxy is using. This is required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Ìtẹ̀ka kọ́kọ́rọ́ RSA gbogbogbòò lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ tí aṣojú ń lò. Èyí pọndandan láti ṣètò ìsopọ̀ tí a gbẹ́kẹ̀lé."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The first Day of the Week for weekly Graph Displays"
msgstr "Ọjọ́ Àkọ́kọ́ ti Ọ̀sẹ̀ fún Àwọn Ìfihàn Gíráfù Ọ̀sẹ̀"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The font to use for Graph Axis items.  Enter a Pango font description, such as DejaVu Sans Bold. RRDtool does not load font files."
msgstr "Fọ́ọ̀ntì láti lò fún àwọn ohun Ákísì Gíráfù. Tẹ àpèjúwe fọ́ọ̀ntì Pango, bíi DejaVu Sans Bold. RRDtool kì í gbé àwọn fáìlì fọ́ọ̀ntì jáde."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The font to use for Graph Legends.  Enter a Pango font description, such as DejaVu Sans Bold. RRDtool does not load font files."
msgstr "Fọ́ọ̀ntì láti lò fún Àwọn Àlàyé àwòrán Gíráfù. Tẹ àpèjúwe fọ́ọ̀ntì Pango, bíi DejaVu Sans Bold. RRDtool kì í gbé àwọn fáìlì fọ́ọ̀ntì jáde."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The font to use for Graph Titles.  Enter a Pango font description, such as DejaVu Sans Bold. RRDtool does not load font files."
msgstr "Fọ́ọ̀ntì láti lò fún Àwọn Àkọlé Gíráfù. Tẹ àpèjúwe fọ́ọ̀ntì Pango, bíi DejaVu Sans Bold. RRDtool kì í gbé àwọn fáìlì fọ́ọ̀ntì jáde."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The font to use for Graph Unit items.  Enter a Pango font description, such as DejaVu Sans Bold. RRDtool does not load font files."
msgstr "Fọ́ọ̀ntì láti lò fún àwọn ohun Ìwọ̀n Gíráfù. Tẹ àpèjúwe fọ́ọ̀ntì Pango, bíi DejaVu Sans Bold. RRDtool kì í gbé àwọn fáìlì fọ́ọ̀ntì jáde."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The frequency that the Kadupul data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Kadupul data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Ìgbàgbọ̀ tí a ó fi bẹ̀rẹ̀ olùkójọ dátà Kadupul. O lè lo yálà crontab, iṣẹ́ tí a tò lẹ́sẹẹsẹ (fún windows), tàbí iṣẹ́ systemd cactid láti darí bíbẹ̀rẹ̀ olùkójọ dátà Kadupul. Fún àwọn ìtọ́ni lórí lílo daemon cactid, ṣàyẹ̀wò fáìlì README.md nínú fódà iṣẹ́."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The height of Thumbnail graphs in pixels."
msgstr "Gíga àwọn gíráfù Àwòrán Kékeré ní píkísẹ́lì."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum Data Query field length."
msgstr "Gígùn ààyè Ìbéèrè Dátà pípọ̀jù."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum allowable Graph or Data Source titles."
msgstr "Àwọn àkọlé Gíráfù tàbí Orísun Dátà pípọ̀jù tí a gbà láàyè."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Kadupul Poller and Boosts Poller"
msgstr "Iye ìrántí pípọ̀jù fún Olùṣàkójọ Kadupul àti Olùṣàkójọ Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Kadupul Poller and Data Source Statistics Poller"
msgstr "Iye ìrántí pípọ̀jù fún Olùṣàkójọ Kadupul àti Olùṣàkójọ Ìṣirò Orísun Dátà"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Background Commands script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed.  This script will perform tasks such as re-indexing Devices and pruning devices from Remote Data Collectors."
msgstr "Iye àkókò pípọ̀jù tí síkíríìtì Àwọn Àṣẹ Abẹ́lẹ̀ ti Kadupul lè ṣiṣẹ́ láìṣẹ̀dá àṣìṣe àkókò-parí àti pípa á. Síkíríìtì yìí yóò ṣe àwọn iṣẹ́ bíi àtúnṣe àtọ́ka Àwọn Ẹ̀rọ àti yíyọ àwọn ẹ̀rọ kúrò láti Àwọn Olùkójọ Dátà Jíjìn."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Data Source Statistics script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Iye àkókò pípọ̀jù tí síkíríìtì Ìṣirò Orísun Dátà ti Kadupul lè ṣiṣẹ́ láìṣẹ̀dá àṣìṣe àkókò-parí àti pípa á."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's RRDfile check script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Iye àkókò pípọ̀jù tí síkíríìtì àyẹ̀wò RRDfile ti Kadupul lè ṣiṣẹ́ láìṣẹ̀dá àṣìṣe àkókò-parí àti pípa á."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Reports Generation script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Iye àkókò pípọ̀jù tí síkíríìtì Ìṣẹ̀dá Ìròyìn ti Kadupul lè ṣiṣẹ́ láìṣẹ̀dá àṣìṣe àkókò-parí àti pípa á."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Kadupul's Maintenance script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Iye àkókò pípọ̀jù tí síkíríìtì Ìtọ́jú Kadupul kan lè ṣiṣẹ́ láìṣẹ̀dá àṣìṣe àkókò-parí àti pípa á."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Kadupul's Spikekill script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Iye àkókò pípọ̀jù tí síkíríìtì Spikekill Kadupul kan lè ṣiṣẹ́ láìṣẹ̀dá àṣìṣe àkókò-parí àti pípa á."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum number of Device Directories to be created based upon hashed Device ID's."
msgstr "Nọ́ńbà pípọ̀jù ti Àwọn Fódà Ẹ̀rọ láti ṣẹ̀dá tó dá lórí àwọn ID Ẹ̀rọ tí a ṣe hash."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum size of the E-Mail message including all attachments."
msgstr "Ìwọ̀n pípọ̀jù ti ìránṣẹ́ Ímeèlì pẹ̀lú gbogbo àwọn àfikún."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Àkókò pípọ̀jù tí spine yóò dúró lórí síkíríìtì kan láti parí. Iye àkókò-parí yìí wà ní ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá, ó sì wúlò fún Olùkójọ Dátà spine nìkan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The method used to Clean RRDfiles from Kadupul after their Data Sources are deleted."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà tí a lò láti Pa Àwọn RRDfile Mọ́ kúrò nínú Kadupul lẹ́yìn tí a bá pa Àwọn Orísun Dátà wọn rẹ́."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The most refused samples one data source may keep queued.  The oldest samples beyond this limit are moved to the poller_output_rejected table immediately."
msgstr "Àwọn àpẹẹrẹ tí a kọ̀ tó pọ̀ jù tí orísun dátà kan lè tọ́jú sí ìlà. Àwọn àpẹẹrẹ tó gbó jù kọjá ààlà yìí ni a gbé lọ sí tábìlì poller_output_rejected lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the guest user for viewing graphs; is 'No User' by default."
msgstr "Orúkọ olùlò àlejò fún wíwo àwọn gíráfù; jẹ́ 'Kò sí Olùlò' nípa àìyípadà."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the primary administrative account that will automatically receive Emails when the Kadupul system experiences issues.  To receive these Emails, ensure that your mail settings are correct, and the administrative account has an Email address that is set."
msgstr "Orúkọ àkọọ́lẹ̀ ìṣàkóso àkọ́kọ́ tí yóò máa gba Àwọn Ímeèlì fúnra rẹ̀ nígbà tí ètò Kadupul bá ní ìṣòro. Láti gba Àwọn Ímeèlì wọ̀nyí, rí i dájú pé àwọn ètò ímeèlì rẹ tọ́, àti pé àkọọ́lẹ̀ ìṣàkóso ní àdírẹ́sì Ímeèlì tí a ṣètò."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the user that Kadupul will use as a template for new Web Basic and LDAP users; is 'guest' by default.  This user account will be disabled from logging in upon being selected."
msgstr "Orúkọ olùlò tí Kadupul yóò lò gẹ́gẹ́ bí àdàkọ fún àwọn olùlò Web Basic àti LDAP tuntun; jẹ́ 'guest' nípa àìyípadà. A ó dá àkọọ́lẹ̀ olùlò yìí dúró kúrò nínú ìwọlé nígbà tí a bá yàn án."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of alert rules read and evaluated together. The time budget is checked between batches."
msgstr "Iye àwọn òfin ìkìlọ̀ tí a kà tí a sì ṣàyẹ̀wò papọ̀. A ń ṣàyẹ̀wò ìṣúná àkókò láàárín àwọn ìdìpọ̀."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of columns to use when displaying Thumbnail graphs in Preview mode."
msgstr "Nọ́ńbà àwọn ọ̀wọ̀n láti lò nígbà tí a bá ń fi àwọn gíráfù Àwòrán Kékeré hàn ní ipò Àwòrán Àkọ́wò."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of columns to use when displaying Thumbnail graphs in Tree mode."
msgstr "Nọ́ńbà àwọn ọ̀wọ̀n láti lò nígbà tí a bá ń fi àwọn gíráfù Àwòrán Kékeré hàn ní ipò Igi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent DSStats processes to use to use to process all of the Data Sources."
msgstr "Nọ́ńbà àwọn ìlànà DSStats tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ lẹ́ẹ̀kan náà láti lò láti ṣiṣẹ́ lórí gbogbo Àwọn Orísun Dátà."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent Poller Command processes.  The will be at most one concurrent command per host within the Poller Command pool."
msgstr "Nọ́ńbà àwọn ìlànà Àṣẹ Olùṣàkójọ tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ lẹ́ẹ̀kan náà. Àṣẹ tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ lẹ́ẹ̀kan náà kan ṣoṣo péré ni yóò wà fún agbàlejò kọ̀ọ̀kan nínú adágún Àṣẹ Olùṣàkójọ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent RRDfile check processes to use to use to process all of rrd files."
msgstr "Nọ́ńbà àwọn ìlànà àyẹ̀wò RRDfile tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ lẹ́ẹ̀kan náà láti lò láti ṣiṣẹ́ lórí gbogbo àwọn fáìlì rrd."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent boost processes to use to use to process all of the RRDs in the boost table."
msgstr "Nọ́ńbà àwọn ìlànà boost tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ lẹ́ẹ̀kan náà láti lò láti ṣiṣẹ́ lórí gbogbo àwọn RRD nínú tábìlì boost."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Nọ́ńbà àwọn ìlànà olupin síkíríìtì tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ lẹ́ẹ̀kan náà láti ṣiṣẹ́ fún ìlànà spine kọ̀ọ̀kan. Àwọn ètò láàárín 1 sí 15 ni a gbà. Àṣàyàn yìí yóò ràn ọ́ lọ́wọ́ tí o bá ń ṣiṣẹ́ ọ̀pọ̀ okùn àti àwọn síkíríìtì olupin síkíríìtì, ó sì wúlò fún Olùkójọ Dátà spine nìkan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of consecutive hours that represent the hourly average.  Keep in mind that a setting too high can result in very large memory tables"
msgstr "Nọ́ńbà àwọn wákàtí títẹ̀léra tí ó dúró fún ìpín ààrin wákàtí. Rántí pé ètò tó ga jù lè yọrí sí àwọn tábìlì ìrántí tó tóbi gan-an"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of graphs to display on one page in preview mode."
msgstr "Nọ́ńbà àwọn gíráfù láti fi hàn lórí ojú-òpó kan ní ipò àwòrán àkọ́wò."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of polling intervals a Device must be down before logging an error and reporting Device as down."
msgstr "Nọ́ńbà àwọn àkókò ìṣàkójọ tí Ẹ̀rọ gbọ́dọ̀ wà nísàlẹ̀ kí a tó kọ àṣìṣe sílẹ̀ kí a sì ròyìn Ẹ̀rọ gẹ́gẹ́ bí nísàlẹ̀."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of polling intervals a Device must remain up before returning Device to an up status and issuing a notice."
msgstr "Nọ́ńbà àwọn àkókò ìṣàkójọ tí Ẹ̀rọ gbọ́dọ̀ wà lókè kí a tó dá Ẹ̀rọ padà sí ipò lókè kí a sì fi ìfitọ́nilétí jáde."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of seconds between automatic page refreshes."
msgstr "Nọ́ńbà àwọn ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá láàárín àwọn ìmúdọ̀tun ojú-òpó aládàáṣe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of times Kadupul will attempt to ping a Device before marking it as down."
msgstr "Nọ́ńbà àwọn ìgbà tí Kadupul yóò gbìyànjú láti ṣàbẹ̀wò sí Ẹ̀rọ kan kí ó tó sàmì sí i gẹ́gẹ́ bí nísàlẹ̀."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The password to authenticate with when sending via SMTP. (Leave blank if you do not require authentication.)"
msgstr "Ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà láti fi fìdí múlẹ̀ nígbà tí a bá ń fi ránṣẹ́ nípasẹ̀ SMTP. (Fi sílẹ̀ ní òfo tí o kò bá nílò ìfìdí múlẹ̀.)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to Spine binary."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà sí bínárì Spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to Spine configuration file.  By default, in the cwd of Spine, or /etc if not specified."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà sí fáìlì ìṣètò Spine. Nípa àìyípadà, nínú cwd ti Spine, tàbí /etc tí a kò bá sọ ọ́."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to the rrdtool binary."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà sí bínárì rrdtool."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to your Kadupul log file (if blank, defaults to &lt;path_cacti&gt;/log/cacti.log)"
msgstr "Ọ̀nà sí fáìlì àkọsílẹ̀ Kadupul rẹ (tí ó bá ṣófo, yóò lo &lt;path_cacti&gt;/log/cacti.log)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to your PHP binary file (may require a php recompile to get this file)."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà sí fáìlì bínárì PHP rẹ (ó lè nílò àtúnkọ php láti gba fáìlì yìí)."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to your snmpbulkwalk binary."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà sí bínárì snmpbulkwalk rẹ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to your snmpget binary."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà sí bínárì snmpget rẹ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to your snmpgetnext binary."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà sí bínárì snmpgetnext rẹ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to your snmptrap binary."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà sí bínárì snmptrap rẹ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to your snmpwalk binary."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà sí bínárì snmpwalk rẹ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The poller type to use.  This setting will take affect at next polling interval."
msgstr "Irú olùṣàkójọ láti lò. Ètò yìí yóò bẹ̀rẹ̀ iṣẹ́ ní àkókò ìṣàkójọ tó kàn."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The polling interval in use.  This setting will affect how often RRDfiles are checked and updated.  <strong><u>NOTE: If you change this value, you must re-populate the poller cache.  Failure to do so, may result in lost data.</u></strong>"
