msgstr "Èyí jẹ́ àkọọ́lẹ̀ Ímeèlì tí a lò fún fífi ìránṣẹ́ àyẹ̀wò ránṣẹ́ láti rí i dájú pé ohun gbogbo ń ṣiṣẹ́ dáadáa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is a the server location that will be used for links to the Kadupul site. This should include the subdirectory if Kadupul does not run from root folder."
msgstr "Èyí ni ibi olupin tí a ó lò fún àwọn ìjápọ̀ sí ibùdó Kadupul. Èyí gbọ́dọ̀ ní fódà abẹ́lẹ̀ tí Kadupul kò bá ṣiṣẹ́ láti inú fódà gbòǹgbò."

#: include/global_settings.php
