#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is essential that the Central Kadupul server can communicate via MySQL to each remote Kadupul database server.  Once the install is complete, you must edit the Remote Data Collector and ensure the settings are correct.  You can verify using the 'Test Connection' when editing the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Ó ṣe pàtàkì pé kí Sẹ́fà Kadupul Àárín lè bá sẹ́fà ibi-ìpamọ́ dátà Kadupul òkèèrè kọ̀ọ̀kan sọ̀rọ̀ nípasẹ̀ MySQL. Ní kété tí ìfisori ẹ̀rọ bá parí, o gbọ́dọ̀ ṣàtúnṣe Olùkó Dátà Òkèèrè kí o sì rí i dájú pé àwọn ètò náà tọ́. O lè fìdí rẹ̀ múlẹ̀ nípa lílo 'Dán Ìsopọ̀ Wò' nígbà tí o bá ń ṣàtúnṣe Olùkó Dátà Òkèèrè."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is strongly suggested that you update your config.php to enable this feature by uncommenting the <b>$input_whitelist</b> variable and then running the three CLI script options above after the web based install has completed."
msgstr "A gbà ọ́ níyànjú gidigidi pé kí o ṣe àtúnṣe config.php rẹ láti mú iṣẹ́ yìí ṣiṣẹ́ nípa yíyọ àwọ̀-ọ̀rọ̀ kúrò lórí oníyípadà <b>$input_whitelist</b> lẹ́yìn náà ṣíṣiṣẹ́ àwọn àṣàyàn ìwé-àṣẹ CLI mẹ́ta lókè lẹ́yìn tí ìfisori ẹ̀rọ orí wẹ́ẹ̀bù bá ti parí."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Kadupul Data Input methods that call a script can be exploited in ways that a non-administrator can perform damage to either files owned by the poller account, and in cases where someone runs the Kadupul poller as root, can compromise the operating system allowing attackers to exploit your infrastructure."
msgstr "Àwọn ọ̀nà Àbáwọlé Dátà Kadupul tí ó ń pe script ni a lè lò lọ́nà ìlòkulò nípa bí ẹni tí kì í ṣe olùṣàkóso ṣe lè ṣe ìbàjẹ́ sí yálà àwọn fáìlì tí àkọọ́lẹ̀ poller ní, àti ní àwọn ipò tí ẹnìkan bá ń ṣiṣẹ́ Kadupul poller gẹ́gẹ́ bí root, ó lè ba ètò ìṣiṣẹ́ jẹ́ tí yóò gba àwọn olùkọlù láàyè láti ṣàkóso ètò rẹ."

