#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please ensure the directory permissions below are correct before proceeding.  During the install, these directories need to be owned by the Web Server user.  These permission changes are required to allow the Installer to install Device Template packages which include XML and script files that will be placed in these directories.  If you choose not to install the packages, there is an 'install_package.php' cli script that can be used from the command line after the install is complete."
msgstr "Jọ̀wọ́ rí i dájú pé àwọn àṣẹ fódà ìsàlẹ̀ wọ̀nyí tọ́ kí o tó tẹ̀síwájú. Nígbà ìfisori ẹ̀rọ, olùmúlò Wẹ́ẹ̀bù Sẹ́fà gbọ́dọ̀ ní àwọn fódà wọ̀nyí. Àwọn àyípadà àṣẹ wọ̀nyí pọn dandan láti gba Olùfisori ẹ̀rọ láàyè láti fi àwọn páàkẹ́ẹ̀tì Àdàkọ Ẹ̀rọ sori ẹ̀rọ tí ó ní àwọn fáìlì XML àti script tí a ó fi sí inú àwọn fódà wọ̀nyí. Tí o bá yan láti má fi àwọn páàkẹ́ẹ̀tì náà sori ẹ̀rọ, ìwé-àṣẹ cli 'install_package.php' kan wà tí a lè lò láti ìlà àṣẹ lẹ́yìn tí ìfisori ẹ̀rọ bá ti parí."

