#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Kadupul configuration has the relative correct path (url_path) in config.php."
msgstr "Ìṣètò Kadupul rẹ ní ọ̀nà ìbámu tó tọ́ (url_path) nínú config.php."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Kadupul database account has access to the MySQL TimeZone database and that database is populated with global TimeZone information."
msgstr "Àkọọ́lẹ̀ dátàbéèsì Kadupul rẹ ní ààyè sí dátàbéèsì Agbègbè Àkókò MySQL àti pé dátàbéèsì yẹn kún fún àlàyé Agbègbè Àkókò àgbáyé."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Kadupul database login account does not have access to the MySQL TimeZone database.  Please provide the Kadupul database account \"select\" access to the \"time_zone_name\" table in the \"mysql\" database, and populate MySQL's TimeZone information before proceeding."
msgstr "Àkọọ́lẹ̀ ìwọlé dátàbéèsì Kadupul rẹ kò ní ààyè sí dátàbéèsì Agbègbè Àkókò MySQL. Jọ̀wọ́ fún àkọọ́lẹ̀ dátàbéèsì Kadupul ní ààyè \"select\" sí tábìlì \"time_zone_name\" nínú dátàbéèsì \"mysql\", kí o sì kún àlàyé Agbègbè Àkókò MySQL kí o tó tẹ̀síwájú."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your MySQL TimeZone database is not populated.  Please populate this database before proceeding."
msgstr "Dátàbéèsì Agbègbè Àkókò MySQL rẹ kò kún. Jọ̀wọ́ kún dátàbéèsì yìí kí o tó tẹ̀síwájú."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Remote Kadupul Poller information has not been included in your config.php file.  Please review the config.php.dist, and set the variables: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, etc.  These variables must be set and point back to your Primary Kadupul database server.  Correct this and try again."
msgstr "A kò fi àlàyé Olùṣàkójọ Kadupul Jíjìn rẹ sínú fáìlì config.php rẹ. Jọ̀wọ́ ṣàyẹ̀wò config.php.dist, kí o sì ṣètò àwọn onírúurú: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, àti bẹ́ẹ̀ bẹ́ẹ̀ lọ. A gbọ́dọ̀ ṣètò àwọn onírúurú wọ̀nyí kí wọ́n sì tọ́ka padà sí olupin dátàbéèsì Àkọ́kọ́ Kadupul rẹ. Ṣàtúnṣe èyí kí o sì tún gbìyànjú."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your config.php file must be writable by the web server during install in order to configure the Remote poller.  Once installation is complete, you must set this file to Read Only to prevent possible security issues."
msgstr "Fáìlì config.php rẹ gbọ́dọ̀ ṣeé kọ̀wé sí láti ọwọ́ olupin wẹ́ẹ̀bù nígbà ìfi-sori-ẹ̀rọ láti ṣètò olùṣàkójọ Jíjìn. Nígbà tí ìfi-sori-ẹ̀rọ bá parí, o gbọ́dọ̀ ṣètò fáìlì yìí sí Kíkà Nìkan láti dènà àwọn ìṣòro ààbò tó ṣeé ṣe."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your database default collation appears to be UTF8 compliant"
msgstr "Ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ lẹ́tà àìyípadà dátàbéèsì rẹ dà bí ẹni pé ó bá UTF8 mu"

