#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MariaDB less than 10.5.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "%s yóò pín innodb_buffer_pool sí àwọn agbègbè ìrántí láti mú ìṣiṣẹ́ dára sí i fún àwọn ẹ̀yà MariaDB tí ó kéré sí 10.5. Iye tó pọ̀ jùlọ ni 64, ṣùgbọ́n kò gbọ́dọ̀ ju iye àwọn kọ́ọ̀rù/okùn ìṣiṣẹ́ CPU lọ. Tí innodb_buffer_pool rẹ bá kéré sí 1GB, o gbọ́dọ̀ lo ìwọ̀n àkójọpọ̀ tí a pín pẹ̀lú 128MB. Máa lo ìṣirò yìí títí dé iye tó pọ̀ jùlọ ti kọ́ọ̀rù CPU tàbí 64."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MySQL upto and including MySQL 8.0.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max of the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "%s yóò pín innodb_buffer_pool sí àwọn agbègbè ìrántí láti mú ìṣiṣẹ́ dára sí i fún àwọn ẹ̀yà MySQL títí dé àti pẹ̀lú MySQL 8.0. Iye tó pọ̀ jùlọ ni 64, ṣùgbọ́n kò gbọ́dọ̀ ju iye àwọn kọ́ọ̀rù/okùn ìṣiṣẹ́ CPU lọ. Tí innodb_buffer_pool rẹ bá kéré sí 1GB, o gbọ́dọ̀ lo ìwọ̀n àkójọpọ̀ tí a pín pẹ̀lú 128MB. Máa lo ìṣirò yìí títí dé iye tó pọ̀ jùlọ ti kọ́ọ̀rù CPU tàbí 64."

