#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Depending on the number of logins and use of spine data collector, %s will need many connections.  The calculation for spine is: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), then you must leave headroom for user connections, which will change depending on the number of concurrent login accounts."
msgstr "Ní ìbámu pẹ̀lú iye àwọn ìwọlé àti lílo olùkó dátà spine, %s yóò nílò ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ àwọn àsopọ̀. Ìṣirò fún spine ni: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), lẹ́yìn náà o gbọ́dọ̀ fi ààyè sílẹ̀ fún àwọn àsopọ̀ olùlò, èyí tí yóò yípadà ní ìbámu pẹ̀lú iye àwọn àkọọ́lẹ̀ ìwọlé lẹ́ẹ̀kan náà."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "If using the Kadupul Performance Booster and choosing a memory storage engine, you have to be careful to flush your Performance Booster buffer before the system runs out of memory table space.  This is done two ways, first reducing the size of your output column to just the right size.  This column is in the tables poller_output, and poller_output_boost.  The second thing you can do is allocate more memory to memory tables.  We have arbitrarily chosen a recommended value of 10%% of system memory, but if you are using SSD disk drives, or have a smaller system, you may ignore this recommendation or choose a different storage engine.  You may see the expected consumption of the Performance Booster tables under Console -> System Utilities -> View Boost Status."
msgstr "Tí o bá ń lo Kadupul Performance Booster tí o sì ń yan ẹ́ńjìnì ìpamọ́ ìrántí, o ní láti ṣọ́ra láti fọ àkójọpọ̀ Performance Booster rẹ kí ètò náà tó parí ààyè tábìlì ìrántí. Èyí ni a ṣe ní ọ̀nà méjì, àkọ́kọ́ dídín ìwọ̀n òpó àbájáde rẹ kù sí ìwọ̀n tí ó tọ́ gan-an. Òpó yìí wà nínú àwọn tábìlì poller_output, àti poller_output_boost. Ohun kejì tí o lè ṣe ni pípín ìrántí sí i fún àwọn tábìlì ìrántí. A ti yan ìníyelórí àbá ti 10%% ti ìrántí ètò láìròtẹ́lẹ̀, ṣùgbọ́n tí o bá ń lo àwọn àwo SSD, tàbí o ní ètò kékeré, o lè kọbi ara sí àbá yìí tàbí yan ẹ́ńjìnì ìpamọ́ mìíràn. O lè rí ìlò tí a retí ti àwọn tábìlì Performance Booster lábẹ́ Console -> System Utilities -> View Boost Status."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 200 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 100000 can be used."
msgstr "Tí o bá ní àwọn àwo SSD, lo àbá yìí. Tí o bá ní àwọn hard drive tí ó ṣe é fọwọ́ kàn, lo 200 * iye àwọn drives tí ń ṣiṣẹ́ nínú array náà. Tí o bá ń lo NVMe tàbí PCIe Flash, àwọn nọ́ńbà tí ó tóbi gan-an tó 100000 ni a lè lò."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 2000 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 200000 can be used."
msgstr "Tí o bá ní àwọn àwo SSD, lo àbá yìí. Tí o bá ní àwọn hard drive tí ó ṣe é fọwọ́ kàn, lo 2000 * iye àwọn drives tí ń ṣiṣẹ́ nínú array náà. Tí o bá ń lo NVMe tàbí PCIe Flash, àwọn nọ́ńbà tí ó tóbi gan-an tó 200000 ni a lè lò."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion. Otherwise, do not set this setting."
msgstr "Tí o bá ní àwọn àwo SSD, lo àbá yìí. Bí bẹ́ẹ̀ kọ́, má ṣe ṣètò ètò yìí."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If your tables have very large indexes, you must operate with the Barracuda innodb_file_format and the innodb_large_prefix equal to 1.  Failure to do this may result in plugins that can not properly create tables."
msgstr "Tí àwọn tábìlì rẹ bá ní àwọn àtọ́ka tí ó tóbi gan-an, o gbọ́dọ̀ ṣiṣẹ́ pẹ̀lú Barracuda innodb_file_format àti innodb_large_prefix tí ó dọ́gba pẹ̀lú 1. Àìṣe èyí lè yọrí sí àwọn plugins tí kò lè ṣẹ̀dá àwọn tábìlì dáadáa."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "InnoDB will hold as much tables and indexes in system memory as is possible.  Therefore, you should make the innodb_buffer_pool large enough to hold as much of the tables and index in memory.  Checking the size of the /var/lib/mysql/cacti directory will help in determining this value.  We are recommending 25%% of your systems total memory, but your requirements will vary depending on your systems size."
msgstr "InnoDB yóò di àwọn tábìlì àti àwọn àtọ́ka púpọ̀ bí ó ti ṣe é ṣe tó mú nínú ìrántí ètò. Nítorí náà, o gbọ́dọ̀ mú kí innodb_buffer_pool tóbi tó láti di púpọ̀ nínú àwọn tábìlì àti àtọ́ka mú nínú ìrántí. Ṣíṣàyẹ̀wò ìwọ̀n fódà /var/lib/mysql/cacti yóò ràn ọ́ lọ́wọ́ láti mọ ìníyelórí yìí. A ń dámọ̀ràn 25%% ti gbogbo ìrántí ètò rẹ, ṣùgbọ́n àwọn ohun tí o nílò yóò yàtọ̀ ní ìbámu pẹ̀lú ìwọ̀n ètò rẹ."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "It is STRONGLY recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.5.3."
msgstr "A gbà ọ́ níyànjú GIDIGIDI pé kí o mú InnoDB ṣiṣẹ́ nínú èyíkéyìí ẹ̀yà %s tí ó tóbi ju 5.5.3 lọ."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "It is recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.1."
msgstr "A gbà ọ́ níyànjú pé kí o mú InnoDB ṣiṣẹ́ nínú èyíkéyìí ẹ̀yà %s tí ó tóbi ju 5.1 lọ."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Keeping the table cache larger means less file open/close operations when using innodb_file_per_table."
msgstr "Fífẹ̀ àkójọpọ̀ ìrántí tábìlì túmọ̀ sí àwọn iṣẹ́ ṣíṣí/títì fáìlì tí ó dín kù nígbà lílo innodb_file_per_table."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum I/O performance happens when you use the O_DIRECT method to flush pages."
msgstr "Iṣẹ́ I/O púpọ̀ jùlọ máa ń ṣẹlẹ̀ nígbà tí o bá lo ọ̀nà O_DIRECT láti fọ àwọn ojú-ewé."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "MySQL 5.6+ and MariaDB 10.0+ are great releases, and are very good versions to choose. Make sure you run the very latest release though which fixes a long standing low level networking issue that was causing spine many issues with reliability."
msgstr "MySQL 5.6+ àti MariaDB 10.0+ jẹ́ àwọn ìtújáde tí ó dára gan-an, wọ́n sì jẹ́ àwọn ẹ̀yà tí ó dára púpọ̀ láti yàn. Rí i dájú pé o ń ṣiṣẹ́ ìtújáde tuntun jùlọ bí ó tilẹ̀ jẹ́ pé ó tún ìṣòro nẹ́tíwọ́ọ̀kì ìpele ìsàlẹ̀ tí ó ti pẹ́ tí ó ń fa ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ ìṣòro pẹ̀lú ìgbẹ́kẹ̀lé fún spine ṣe."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Note: Many changes below require a database restart"
msgstr "Àkíyèsí: Ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ àwọn àyípadà ìsàlẹ̀ nílò àtúnbẹ̀rẹ̀ ibi-ìpamọ́ dátà"

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "PHP %s is the minimum version"
msgstr "PHP %s ni ẹ̀yà tí ó kéré jùlọ"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Recommended Value"
msgstr "Ìníyelórí Tí A Dámọ̀ràn"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Rogue queries should not for the database to go offline to others.  Kill these queries before they kill your system."
msgstr "Àwọn ìbéèrè apànìyàn kò gbọ́dọ̀ fa kí ibi-ìpamọ́ dátà lọ sí offline fún àwọn mìíràn. Pa àwọn ìbéèrè wọ̀nyí kí wọ́n tó pa ètò rẹ."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Setting this value to 2 means that you will flush all transactions every second rather than at commit.  This allows %s to perform writing less often."
msgstr "Ṣíṣètò iye yìí sí 2 túmọ̀ sí pé o ó máa tú gbogbo ìṣòwò jáde lẹ́ẹ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan ní ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá kọ̀ọ̀kan dípò nígbà ìfipamọ́. Èyí ń jẹ́ kí %s kọ̀wé díẹ̀ sí i."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This is where metadata is stored. If you had a lot of tables, it would be useful to increase this."
msgstr "Èyí ni ibi tí a ti ń tọ́jú metadata. Tí o bá ní ọ̀pọ̀ tábìlì, yóò wúlò láti mú èyí pọ̀ sí i."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This settings should remain ON unless your Kadupul instances is running on either ZFS or FusionI/O which both have internal journaling to accommodate abrupt system crashes.  However, if you have very good power, and your systems rarely go down and you have backups, turning this setting to OFF can net you almost a 50% increase in database performance."
msgstr "Àwọn ètò yìí gbọ́dọ̀ wà ní TÍTÀN àyàfi bí àpẹẹrẹ Kadupul rẹ bá ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí yálà ZFS tàbí FusionI/O tí àwọn méjèèjì ní àkọsílẹ̀ inú láti gbà fún ìfọ́ ètò òjijì. Síbẹ̀síbẹ̀, tí o bá ní iná tó dára gan-an, tí àwọn ètò rẹ kì í sì í lọ sílẹ̀ láìròtẹ́lẹ̀ tí o sì ní àfikún ìpamọ́, pípa ètò yìí sí PÍPA lè fún ọ ní ìdàgbàsókè iṣẹ́ dátàbéèsì tó fẹ́rẹ̀ẹ́ tó 50%."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "Onírúurú"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When executing subqueries, having a larger temporary table size, keep those temporary tables in memory."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a bá ń ṣiṣẹ́ àwọn ìbéèrè abẹ́lẹ̀, níní ìwọ̀n tábìlì ìgbà díẹ̀ tó tóbi jù ń pa àwọn tábìlì ìgbà díẹ̀ wọ̀nyẹn mọ́ sínú ìrántí."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When performing joins, if they are below this size, they will be kept in memory and never written to a temporary file.  As this is a per connection memory allocation, care must be taken not to increase it too high.  The sum of the join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + Core MySQL/MariaDB memory should be below 80%.  If the recommendation is negative, you must decrease this and or the sort_buffer_size until the recommendation fits within the allowable memory."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a bá ń ṣe àwọn ìdàpọ̀ (joins), tí wọ́n bá kéré sí ìwọ̀n yìí, a ó pa wọ́n mọ́ sínú ìrántí a kò sì ní kọ wọ́n sí fáìlì ìgbà díẹ̀ rí. Nítorí pé èyí jẹ́ ìpín ìrántí fún ìsopọ̀ kọ̀ọ̀kan, a gbọ́dọ̀ ṣọ́ra láti má ṣe mú un pọ̀ sí i jù. Àpapọ̀ join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + Ìrántí Pàtàkì MySQL/MariaDB gbọ́dọ̀ wà lábẹ́ 80%. Tí àbá náà bá jẹ́ òdì, o gbọ́dọ̀ dín èyí àti tàbí sort_buffer_size kù títí àbá náà yóò fi wọ inú ìrántí tí a gbà láàyè."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "When using InnoDB storage it is important to keep your table spaces separate.  This makes managing the tables simpler for long time users of %s.  If you are running with this currently off, you can migrate to the per file storage by enabling the feature, and then running an alter statement on all InnoDB tables."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a bá ń lo ìpamọ́ InnoDB ó ṣe pàtàkì láti ya àwọn ààyè tábìlì rẹ sọ́tọ̀. Èyí mú ṣíṣàkóso àwọn tábìlì rọrùn fún àwọn olùlò ọjọ́ pípẹ́ ti %s. Tí o bá ń ṣiṣẹ́ pẹ̀lú èyí ní pípa lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́, o lè ṣí lọ sí ìpamọ́ fún fáìlì kọ̀ọ̀kan nípa mímú ẹ̀yà náà ṣiṣẹ́, lẹ́yìn náà ṣiṣẹ́ àṣẹ alter lórí gbogbo tábìlì InnoDB."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Kadupul with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4 character set as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a bá ń lo Kadupul pẹ̀lú àwọn èdè mìíràn yàtọ̀ sí Gẹ̀ẹ́sì, ó ṣe pàtàkì láti lo àtòjọ lẹ́tà utf8mb4 nítorí àwọn lẹ́tà kan ń gba ju báìtì kan lọ."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Kadupul with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4_unicode_ci collation type as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a bá ń lo Kadupul pẹ̀lú àwọn èdè mìíràn yàtọ̀ sí Gẹ̀ẹ́sì, ó ṣe pàtàkì láti lo irú ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ lẹ́tà utf8mb4_unicode_ci nítorí àwọn lẹ́tà kan ń gba ju báìtì kan lọ."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, this setting should be off if atomic writes are enabled.  Therefore, please enable atomic writes instead of the double write buffer as it will increase performance."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a bá ń lo MariaDB 10.2.4 àti jù bẹ́ẹ̀ lọ, ètò yìí gbọ́dọ̀ wà ní pípa tí àwọn ìkọ̀wé átọ́míìkì bá wà ní títàn. Nítorí náà, jọ̀wọ́ mú àwọn ìkọ̀wé átọ́míìkì ṣiṣẹ́ dípò double write buffer nítorí yóò mú iṣẹ́ pọ̀ sí i."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, you can use atomic writes over the doublewrite buffer to increase performance."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a bá ń lo MariaDB 10.2.4 àti jù bẹ́ẹ̀ lọ, o lè lo àwọn ìkọ̀wé átọ́míìkì dípò doublewrite buffer láti mú iṣẹ́ pọ̀ sí i."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using innodb_file_per_table, it is important to set the innodb_file_format to Barracuda.  This setting will allow longer indexes important for certain Kadupul tables."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a bá ń lo innodb_file_per_table, ó ṣe pàtàkì láti ṣètò innodb_file_format sí Barracuda. Ètò yìí yóò gba àwọn àtọ́ka tó gùn jù láàyè tí ó ṣe pàtàkì fún àwọn tábìlì Kadupul kan."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With Remote polling capabilities, large amounts of data will be synced from the main server to the remote pollers.  Therefore, keep this value at or above 16M."
msgstr "Pẹ̀lú àwọn agbára ìṣàkójọ Jíjìn, ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ dátà ni a ó mú báramu láti olupin àkọ́kọ́ sí àwọn olùṣàkójọ jíjìn. Nítorí náà, pa iye yìí mọ́ sí tàbí ju 16M lọ."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Pẹ̀lú ìpamọ́ irú SSD òde òní, níní ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ okùn io ṣe àǹfààní fún àwọn ohun èlò tó ní àwọn ànímọ́ io gíga."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Pẹ̀lú ìpamọ́ irú SSD òde òní, níní ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ okùn kíkà io ṣe àǹfààní fún àwọn ohun èlò tó ní àwọn ànímọ́ io gíga."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Pẹ̀lú ìpamọ́ irú SSD òde òní, níní ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ okùn kíkà io ṣe àǹfààní fún àwọn ohun èlò tó ní àwọn ànímọ́ io gíga. Ní ìbámu pẹ̀lú àwọn ẹ̀dà MariaDB/MySQL rẹ, iye yìí lè ga tó 64. Ṣùgbọ́n gbìyànjú láti jẹ́ kí nọ́ńbà náà kéré sí àpapọ̀ àwọn okùn SMT rẹ lórí olupin dátàbéèsì."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Pẹ̀lú ìpamọ́ irú SSD òde òní, níní ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ okùn kíkọ io ṣe àǹfààní fún àwọn ohun èlò tó ní àwọn ànímọ́ io gíga."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Pẹ̀lú ìpamọ́ irú SSD òde òní, níní ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ okùn kíkọ io ṣe àǹfààní fún àwọn ohun èlò tó ní àwọn ànímọ́ io gíga. Ní ìbámu pẹ̀lú àwọn ẹ̀dà MariaDB/MySQL rẹ, iye yìí lè ga tó 64. Ṣùgbọ́n gbìyànjú láti jẹ́ kí nọ́ńbà náà kéré sí àpapọ̀ àwọn okùn SMT rẹ lórí olupin dátàbéèsì."

