#: user_domains.php
msgid "Mode which cacti will attempt to authenticate against the LDAP server.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - No Distinguished Name (DN) searching occurs, just attempt to bind with the provided Distinguished Name (DN) format.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via anonymous binding to locate the users Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Attempts search for username against LDAP directory via Specific Distinguished Name (DN) and Specific Password for binding to locate the users Distinguished Name (DN)."
msgstr "Ipò iṣẹ́ tí cacti yóò gbìyànjú láti fìdí ìdánimọ̀ múlẹ̀ sí sẹ́fà LDAP.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - Kò sí àwárí Distinguished Name (DN) tí ó ń ṣẹlẹ̀, kàn gbìyànjú láti so pọ̀ pẹ̀lú ọ̀nà ìṣètò Distinguished Name (DN) tí a pèsè.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Ó máa ń gbìyànjú láti wá orúkọ olùmúlò lára ìtòjọ LDAP nípasẹ̀ ìsopọ̀ àìmọ̀ láti wá Distinguished Name (DN) àwọn olùmúlò náà.<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Ó máa ń gbìyànjú àwárí fún orúkọ olùmúlò lára ìtòjọ LDAP nípasẹ̀ Specific Distinguished Name (DN) àti Specific Password fún ìsopọ̀ láti wá Distinguished Name (DN) àwọn olùmúlò náà."

